    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, to address the need for contextualization, our can utilize Our Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities with a hybrid retrieval strategy, combining dense vector and BM25 sparse retrievers, and explore the use of semantic chunking for more effective text processing. our experience with vector stores like Qdrant and Weaviate can also help our design an efficient and scalable solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, while our current AI capabilities provide a solid foundation, innovations in knowledge graphs, multi-agent collaboration, and explainability will be essential to delivering a comprehensive and effective solution that meets The client requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client information systems, with a focus on reducing energy consumption and relying on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed solution should contribute to sustainable development and minimize The proposed solution ecological impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What eco-friendly solutions can we propose, and how will they align with the client's sustainability goals? we can propose several eco-friendly solutions that align with the client's sustainability goals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., has partnerships with green hosting providers such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which are based in France and use 100% renewable energy. green hosting providers such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which are based in France and use 100% renewable energy data centers have a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.3 and 1.28 respectively, indicating efficient energy use." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we practice digital sobriety through techniques like model quantization, which reduces GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching to reduce recomputes by around 20%, and adhering to a green IT hardware procurement policy that ensures a minimum 5-year lifecycle for we equipment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By adopting these solutions, we can help the client reduce the client environmental footprint. we typical energy reduction compared to baseline is around 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we carbon reporting capability, aligned with GRI Standards (partial), will enable we to monitor and report on the carbon impact of we operations, ensuring transparency in we sustainability efforts." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These proposals are designed to support the client's objectives of minimizing ecological impact and contributing to sustainable development by leveraging low-carbon infrastructure and reducing energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's digital transformation strategy aims to improve the efficiency of The City of Belval's administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve improve, The City of Belval's propose an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions. an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in their daily missions will provide an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from municipal agents work environment, capable of accompanying municipal agents in municipal agents administrative activities. an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in their daily missions will cover functionalities such as assistance with consultation of information, drafting, instruction of files, and collaboration and continuity of processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, The City of Belval's Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities can provide contextualized answers by combining a retriever model with a generator model." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's will also explore knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning to improve an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in their daily missions ability to understand municipal regulations and procedures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's technical architecture will utilize a SecNumCloud-certified cloud provider like Outscale, with a containerised deployment using Docker and Kubernetes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's will use Kong as The City of Belval's API gateway to integrate with civil-status and town-planning software, EDM systems like Alfresco or Maarch Courrier, and user directories like Active Directory or Keycloak." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To minimize dependencies on non-European suppliers, The City of Belval's will use open-source alternatives where possible." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance, an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in their daily missions will achieve a p95 response time of 1800 ms, meeting the client's requirement of a response time < 2 seconds." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's typical availability is 99.92%, exceeding the client's requirement of 99.9% availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's will also implement robust encryption mechanisms for both in-transit and at-rest data, and enhance The City of Belval's access control standards to ensure that only authorized personnel can handle sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee data sovereignty and protection, The City of Belval's will host data exclusively on the territory of the European Union, with no transfer of data outside the European Union authorized." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's standard data residency is the European Union only, and The City of Belval's have a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits transfers outside the European Union unless there is an explicit legal basis." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's will also implement anonymisation tools such as Microsoft Presidio and custom NER models to protect sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's is financially eligible to bid, with a maximum contract value eligible of 3,000,000 euros, matching the total contract value." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's aim for a target gross margin of 28 percent, which would result in a projected margin of 840,000 euros on the total contract value." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's are compliant with the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR), operating intra-EU only and having a Data Protection Agreement template version 3.2 available." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's expertise in EU AI Act compliance, including transparency obligations for limited-risk AI and contractual enforcement of human oversight, ensures that The City of Belval's can meet the requirement for explainable AI recommendations post-hoc." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To support the client's sustainability goals, The City of Belval's propose eco-friendly solutions such as partnering with green hosting providers like OVHcloud and Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's practice digital sobriety through techniques like model quantization, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and adhering to a green IT hardware procurement policy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's typical energy reduction compared to baseline is around 35%. an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in their daily missions will be deployed in a progressive manner, with a pilot phase on a limited scope and a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's will provide accompaniment to change and actions of training for the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget allocated to the project is estimated at 3 million euros over a duration of 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that will remain mastered and compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in their daily missions meets the client's requirements for an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions, while ensuring data sovereignty, protection, and sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's are confident that an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in their daily missions will improve the efficiency of The City of Belval's administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Technical constraints 5.1 Performance The expected solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk17> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk19> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Interfaces of API type will be expected. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk2> a prov:Entity ;
