    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects an artificial intelligence solution that can assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions, providing intelligent assistance tools for information search, drafting, and file instruction. an artificial intelligence solution that can assist municipal agents in their daily missions, providing intelligent assistance tools for information search, drafting, and file instruction must be able to contextualize answers, generate high-quality content, and facilitate collaboration between agents." ;
