    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current AI capabilities meet these requirements, and what innovations do you propose? our current AI capabilities can partially meet The client requirements. our have experience with large language models such as Mistral 7B, which can be fine-tuned for specific tasks like information search and content generation. our Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities can also provide contextualized answers by combining a retriever model with a generator model." ;
